  "title": "CacheMind: From Miss Rates to Why - Natural-Language, Trace-Grounded Reasoning for Cache Replacement",
  "abstract": "Cache replacement remains a challenging problem in CPU microarchitecture, often addressed using hand-crafted heuristics that limit cache performance. Cache data analysis requires parsing millions of trace entries with manual filtering, making the process slow and non-interactive.",
